{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8b79047f33eff30f704809e68d5a367052c32e63dc9324aab4dadd9a81ce808a", "ja": "（お披露目公演も、ついに佳境を迎えた！\n客席も大盛り上がりだし、このままなら……）", "zh": "（首次亮相公演终于要迎向高潮了！\n观众席也相当热络，照这样看来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "7dc1ab3a514a2557f9b1f75c62831387ef6a832dea7edc636bd0fc3134ce9073", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "904620f0597ae707b01ffa721e5ed40ea10e99cc9788e6404633b8ec6a57358f", "ja": "おっ、静香！　さっきの曲、声も伸びてて、すごく\nよかったぞ。このまま最後までがんばってくれよ！", "zh": "哦，静香！刚才那首曲子嗓音很响亮，\n唱得非常棒喔。就照这个步调加油到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "120ad77d131c3d7f974c2461edbb11a802022c4bd18d42017e079d24a2739323", "ja": "は、はい、私なら平気です。まだまだいけますから。\nそれより……。", "zh": "好、好的。我没问题，还可以继续努力。\n比起这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "59c9a0084d36d28825eeda6180dc223670bfd3abf65ce8a229aceffc312311c4", "ja": "幕が下りる前に、アンケート回収用の段ボール、\nちゃんと出しておいてくれました？", "zh": "在落幕前，\n你有确实摆出回收问卷用的纸箱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "45025076cb97ae51a6f96321f3618d6d2835b43a90e69e2c473bba8376f399f5", "ja": "アンケート？　……集めるんだっけ？", "zh": "问卷……有要搜集问卷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "028ec09e212db1d1a25540f9f5d4c8413714028e2f2655623c5f5c3e51fb0f16", "ja": "やっぱり。もう、ちゃんと言ったのに……。\nほら、そこの机にも置いてあるじゃないですか。", "zh": "我就知道。真是的，我明明有好好跟你说过……\n你看，那张桌子上不是也有放吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "d53517948c7a06545d587c6fa171719d5c8a0d19182be3a1204f22e294b60583", "ja": "今後の参考のためにも、お客さんの生の声をちゃんと\n聞きたいと思って、作ったんですから。……私が。", "zh": "这可是为了直接听取观众心声，\n方便今后参考而设计的问卷啊……是我设计的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dc45df37b15e68528fb974ca216031f42c73ba2b34cb467d8141f93b3ad3beac", "ja": "そういえば、静香達の作った宣伝チラシも\n評判だったよな……これか。どれどれ？", "zh": "这么说来，我记得静香你们做的宣传单\n也很受好评呢……就是这份吗，我看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "00ca6bfdc23c29a7c72d0028a88a6d30f6f1f84e702e3a5736f8538bf2de93a0", "ja": "うん、いいじゃないか。とってもかわいいぞ。\nなるほど、この絵は……フェアリーか。", "zh": "嗯，挺不错的，很可爱喔。\n原来如此，这里画的是……妖精吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "fbbd831ce74814db199e6b66e25956945ea661bbc13dad36ed2b724b4d095290", "ja": "いえ、それはキリンです。\nかわいいですよね、キリン。", "zh": "不，那是长颈鹿。\n很可爱对吧，长颈鹿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "753fcb301a7d0d32bfc45ec4ca00485cd6cca3e543e0c9e7f1c5a5b2cc801ce6", "ja": "そ、そうだな！\nキリン、かわいいと思うよ。", "zh": "是、是啊！\n我觉得长颈鹿很可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "e0282e2984f66607677f54c8e40a19a5863d2db94764d5d3be512c1ea68f01f5", "ja": "手書きのこういうのって……、いいですよね。\n心が通じ合えそうな気がします。", "zh": "这种手绘的图……很不错呢。\n有种能心意相通的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e1de9b3ca3bda9f2edff8760becddc24c8baaa96f203bb59056dc63e0146838c", "ja": "そうだな。実際、静香達の作ったチラシを見て、\n公演に来てくれた人も多かったみたいだし。", "zh": "是啊，事实上好像也有很多人是\n看了静香你们做的传单才来看公演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "e8beff254c794ae3695d924e15b18408970eaf3275413591df17d6474f2e528f", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか！？　そっか……。\nみんな、見てくれたんだ……！", "zh": "咦？是这样子吗！？这样啊……\n大家有看到我们的传单吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3d9326174df15f7609eda69af61b47b684511fb925b3be2d0adc902f1ddbba72", "ja": "さあ、そろそろラストの曲だ。最後はアイドルらしく、\nステージの上から心を届けようか！", "zh": "好啦，差不多要唱最后一首歌了。最后就拿出\n偶像的样子，把你们的心意从舞台上传递出去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "5aeed0ab2ff68144a37971ce01f9ccbc9d424f4b9817928860fd1ce970ac2e93", "ja": "あっ。わ、わかってます、そんなこと。\nそれじゃ……行ってきます！", "zh": "啊，这、这我知道啦。\n那么……我上场啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "28733ba98c6313eac8ee1b8d5e214a6e2b81ac3cdefda22900d97604d45ba882", "ja": "あ！　段ボール、忘れないでくださいね！", "zh": "啊！别忘了要摆出纸箱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1cebe100714deaf20c0e4fc0d0dd77d97d5be4fc6a4f8e771d4e5826957e0e70", "ja": "（今日の満足感と、明日への期待感。\n二つの喜びを抱えて、ステージへと駆け出していく）", "zh": "（对今天的满足感，以及对明天的期待感。\n心怀着这两种喜悦的静香，就这么跑上了舞台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0043_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6a8bba0a0ba30157dbdf13826d5f5f3c639448aa9cbcbf0ef0fa7cb3038e20ad", "ja": "（このアンケートには、その喜びを共有してくれた、\nたくさんの想いが綴られるだろう……！）", "zh": "（一定会有许多和她共享了同样喜悦的人们，\n愿意在这些问卷中留下自己的感想吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
